  "latest_note": "Swapped the pager labels (transcript-view.ts): backward/offset-- is now '← Older', forward/hasMore is now 'Newer →', matching the actual oldest-first chronology. getTranscriptPage (transcript.ts) now returns an exact 'total' once hasMore is false; the view redirects (302) an out-of-range offset onto the last real page instead of rendering a nonsense 'records N+1-N' summary. Guarded the summary line for the zero-records case too. Updated D5.test.ts's existing pager assertions and added a dedicated out-of-range-offset test, plus unit tests for total in transcript.test.ts. Full verification suite green.",
